  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Entrepreneurship Program for Innovation in the Caribbean Multi Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EPIC is designed to create and grow competitive MSMEs across the  Caribbean region. It will help entrepreneurs overcome persistent  market challenges facing owners and managers of MSMEs in the Caribbean  region by: (i) using business incubation to provide a sustainable  suite of services for start-up entrepreneurs compromising advisory  servicescomma mentorshipcomma and access to infrastructure; (ii) upgrading  skills and capabilities of regional incubator managers and  policymakers for supporting MSME development; and (iii) providing seed  funding to promising MSMEs to help them successful scale their  operations.</narrative>
  </description>
